Subject: [PATCH] Preserve the provisioning EEPROM no-op output contract

cmprovision uses this message to distinguish a skipped write from a verified
write. Report it only when write_by_layout confirms that every block was
skipped; keep success and failure handling unchanged.

--- a/flashrom.c
+++ b/flashrom.c
@@ -2039,6 +2039,9 @@
 		goto _finalize_ret;
 	}
 
+	if (all_skipped)
+		msg_cinfo("Chip content is identical to the requested image.\n");
+
 	/* Verify only if we actually changed something. */
 	if (verify && !all_skipped) {
 		msg_cinfo("Verifying flash... ");
